{"id":3845,"name":"Soredemo Ayumu wa Yosetekuru","slug":"soredemo_ayumu_wa_yosetekuru","synopsis":"On a whim, first-year Ayumu Tanaka quits the Kendo Club to join the illegitimate Shogi Club. Urushi Yaotome, the president of the club and a master of shogi, is thrilled to finally have a playing partner. As Ayumu's upperclassman, Urushi endeavors to be his shogi mentor and student role model. Too often, however, she finds herself blushing with embarrassment! Stone-faced and honest, Ayumu sees no issue with calling Urushi \"cute.\" Although Ayumu likes her, he refrains from confessing and promises himself to first beat her in a game of shogi.\r\n\r\nThrough school life and shogi games, the two students have many hilarious and heart-warming adventures. Ayumu enjoys every second with Urushi, but he is still a long way from beating her in shogi. With the commitment he made to himself, will Ayumu ever get the chance to confess his feelings to Urushi?\r\n\r\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2022,"createdAt":"2022-07-07 04:55:59","updatedAt":"2022-07-07 04:55:59","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":45653},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":128223},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":15975},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":43909},{"site":"ANN","externalId":24504},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":16182},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":9670,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/lW7aCWsjRZDSoX7JhJiPG8TGZiDoZNXUI9OcUOfy.jpg"},{"id":9671,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/FGvFfTWmMNWEpdsWIAY7y2G7LhxWo2kNMn4Pnfz5.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":59,"name":"SILVER LINK.","slug":"silver_link"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":11635,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":11635,"title":"Kakehiki wa Poker Face","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":13528,"version":1,"episodes":"1-3, 5-9, 11-